client
dev tun
proto tcp-client
remote https://poormoosait-beep.github.io/vpn-config/ovpn/config.ovpn
port 1194
nobind
persist-key
persist-tun
tls-client
remote-cert-tls server
ca ca.crt
cert client.crt
key  client.key
verb 4
mute 10
cipher AES-256-CBC
auth SHA1
auth-user-pass secret
auth-nocache
;redirect-gateway def1
